We solve the equation and answer the question.
         m \amp{}+ 35\amp \amp{}=  ~293 \amp\amp  \qquad \blert{\text{Subtract 35 from both sides.}}

        \amp\underline{{}-{}\blert{35}} \amp  \amp\quad \underline{{}-{}\blert{35}}


